    {
      "file": "src/core/net/ip6_address.cpp",
      "function": "ot::Ip6::Address::FromString",
      "line": null,
      "code": "endp -= kIp4AddressSize;",
      "note": "When the final `.` selects embedded-IPv4 mode after 14 IPv6 bytes have already been written, this subtracts four bytes from `endp`, moving it to `mFields.m8 + 11` while `dst` is already `mFields.m8 + 13`. The fixing patch inserts `VerifyOrExit(dst <= endp, error = OT_ERROR_PARSE)` here; in the staged vulnerable source execution falls straight to the compaction loop with `dst > endp`.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
    {
